      "compose_image_names": [],
      "tag_variables": [],
      "notes": "SBSA (Grace/DGX-Spark) build of vss-rt-embed. It cannot be another platform in the normal multiarch manifest because SBSA and Jetson both report linux/arm64 but require different DeepStream bases. It shares the vss-rt-embed GHCR repository and uses the -sbsa tag suffix; Compose and Helm select it by overriding only the tag."
    },
