      "notes": "Built by GitHub with the managed first-party image set. The Dockerfile builds on the public DeepStream SDK image, which is anonymously pullable, rather than the private nvstaging base that would need NGC credentials GitHub Actions does not have. SBSA is the sibling vss-rt-cv-sbsa entry, not a platform of this multiarch manifest."
    },
